// A role is per-control, and INTERACTION is the only declaration meaning an act
// bound to an object. ROLE on a SCREEN would claim the whole surface is inert, which
// means nothing. The value is lawful, so UNKNOWN_ROLE stays quiet, and FIELD_MISPLACED
// leaves ROLE to this diagnostic so the defect is reported once.
// Expected: ROLE_MISPLACED

DEFINE SCREEN ledger_overview (
  SATISFIES [READ],
  ROLE inert
)
